  data: {
    LLM: "Keep your eyes on the spoons, not just your cards. If you see movement in the center, grab first, ask questions later. Don't hold disparate cards; focus on one rank early (e.g., if you have two 5s, discard everything else to find the other two 5s).\n\nThe 'Sneaky' Grab: If you get 4 of a kind, quietly take a spoon without anyone noticing. Continue playing/passing cards with one hand while holding the spoon. Watch the chaos unfold as others realize slowly.\n\nThe 'Fake' Reach: Reach towards the spoons to make everyone panic-grab. Rules often penalize this (e.g., you lose a life if you touch a spoon without 4 of a kind). Use with caution.",
